","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109630.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-21T11:27:09Z"},"body":"I came across this code added in PR #107388 with a redundant list of extensions, and this comment:\r\n\r\n```\r\n// Now find anything we support through plugins, which is a bit of a pain as they are converted to Strings\r\n// and we need to convert them back.\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt's actually not a pain, GLTFDocument has function exactly for this purpose. In fact, this function was actually [requested for this purpose](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96251#pullrequestreview-2267525490) but forgotten about. So, this PR uses it. The only complexity still in the OpenXR code is to convert Godot's `HashSet<String>` to a `Vector<const char *>` to pass to OpenXR, and the logic has been updated to only resize the arrays once, avoiding dynamic memory allocation.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes